	(text_box "The NL7SZ57 is used as a combiner for our POWER_OK and POWER_OK_{posedge} signals:\n\nWe want to drive the ~{RESET} lane via Q1004 low if:\n1. POWER_OK=L\n2. POWER_OK=H and POWER_OK_{posedge}=H\n\nIf we observe the truth table of the NL7SZ57, we see that when using:\nA = POWER_OK\nB = POWER_OK_{posedge}\nC = POWER_OK\n\nwe get exactly that function.\n\nThis means that we keep ~{RESET} low for the trigger time of U1003 after POWER_OK goes high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.85 114.3 0)
		(size 38.1 32.9822)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
