	(text_box "The minimum value of external resistance, R_{X}, is typically 500Ω.\nThe minimum value of external capacitance, C_{X}, is 0pF.\nThe calculation for the pulse width is tW = 0.7 R_{X}C_{X} at VCC = 4.5V.\n\n0.7 * 10 kΩ * 10 uF = 0.07 s = 70 ms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.57 24.13 0)
		(size 35.56 14.9894)
